Method: Placebo-controlled trials were included that investigated MPH dosing effects on neurocognitive functions in children and adolescents (aged 
5–18 years) diagnosed with ADHD. Effect sizes (standardized mean differences [SMDs]) were calculated for different neurocognitive functions (baseline 
