- Minimum Daily Budget: Technically you can start with ₹50–₹150 a day. Practically speaking, that’s not enough for the algorithm to do anything useful. A daily budget under ₹300 barely generates enough data in a week to make a single informed decision. For a local business starting out, ₹500–₹1,000/day gives the campaign room to breathe and learn.
