### Facebook Lead Ads (Instant Forms)

Lead Ads display a form inside the Facebook or Instagram app. When a user taps your CTA, a form appears pre-populated with information from their profile (name, email, phone). The user can submit without leaving the platform.

User flow: See ad, tap CTA, form opens (pre-filled), tap Submit, done. Total steps: 2-3. Total time: under 10 seconds.

### Landing Page Approach

The traditional approach sends users to an external webpage — a dedicated landing page with a form, copy, social proof, and design optimized for conversion.

