A retrospective cross-sectional design was used to collect data from maternity registries, patient files, and healthcare providers in 13 rural hospitals served by Zipline drones between May and October 2023. Purposive sampling identified the study population. Data were compared across two timeframes: 12 months before and 12 months after Zipline’s implementation.
