ARTAccess, is a digital health system initially developed to support ART refills through private pharmacies.

It was integrated with facility-based Uganda EMR and Clinic master systems for seamless communication and interoperability.

It facilitates real-time communication between pharmacies and health facilities, tracks medicine stock, and ensures continuity of care.

In 2021, the system was adopted by MOH and scaled to 122 facilities and 184 private pharmacies, enrolling over 60,000 clients by Aug 2025.
