Between June and September 2024, together with the Ministry of Health and partners, we expanded ARTAccess to include an NCD and FP module.
...
From October 2024 to July 2025, 4107 clients were enrolled for integrated HIV, NCD, and FP services.

2977 (72.5%) clients accessed FP services, including Sayana Press, contraceptive pills, Depo-Provera, and condoms

846 (20.6%) to accessed hypertension refills (including amlodipine, losartan, bisoprolol, nifedipine and telmisartan).

About 68 (1.6%) accessed diabetes refills (such as metformin, glibenclamide and soluble insulin),

216 (5.3%) received refills for both HTN and DM.
