committee composition requirements set forth in Rules 5605(d)(2) and  (e)(1)(B)
as follows: (1) one member must satisfy the requirements by the date the
transaction closes;  (2) a majority of members must satisfy the requirements within
90 days of the Listing Date; and (3) all members must satisfy the requirements
within one year of the Listing Date.  Regarding the requirement to have at least
two members on the compensation committee set forth in Rule 5605(d)(2)(A), the
Company must have at least one member on its compensation committee by the

