the listing if the Company meets all applicable initial listing requirements, as well as the conditions described
below.

(a)   At least 90% of the gross proceeds from the initial public oﬀering and any concurrent sale by the
company of equity securities must be deposited in a trust account maintained by an independent trustee, an
escrow account maintained by an "insured depository institution," as that term is deﬁned in Section 3(c)(2) of
the Federal Deposit Insurance Act or in a separate bank account established by a registered broker or dealer
