# A DNA damage checkpoint response in telomere-initiated senescence

- Fabrizio d'Adda di Fagagna 1 nAff4, 
- Philip M. Reaper 1, 
- Lorena Clay-Farrace 1, 
- Heike Fiegler 2, 
