# TARGETING PRO-INFLAMMATORY CELLS IN IDIOPATHIC PULMONARY FIBROSIS: AN OPEN-LABEL PILOT STUDY OF DASATINIB AND QUERCETIN

ANOOP NAMBIAR, MD, FCCP ∙ JAMIE JUSTICE ∙ RODOLFO PASCUAL ∙ … ∙ TAMAR TCHKONIA ∙ NATHAN LEBRASSEUR ∙ JAMES KIRKLAND ∙ NICOLAS MUSI ∙ STEPHEN KRITCHEVSKY … Show more Show less
