 Wirral, United Kingdom 

 FutureMeds is a clinical trial site network and decentralized clinical trial (DCT) service provider that connects patients, healthcare professionals, sponsors, and contract research organizations (CROs) to support clinical research. The company operates research sites across multiple European countries and focuses on patient recruitment, trial delivery, and helping bring new treatments to patients more quickly. FutureMeds was founded in 2019 and is based in Wirral, United Kingdom.
