- EB-2 NIW — Immigrant, self-petition, no employer or PERM, three-prong Dhanasar test focused on the endeavor's national importance.
- O-1A — Nonimmigrant, requires U.S. petitioner (can be your own U.S. entity), 3 of 8 criteria plus totality review, renewable indefinitely.
- EB-1A — Immigrant, self-petition, no employer or PERM, 3 of 10 criteria plus higher totality bar ("very top of the field").
