EB-2 NIW, EB-1A, and O-1A are three of the most powerful U.S. immigration pathways for high-skilled engineers. EB-2 NIW and EB-1A allow you to self-petition without an employer sponsor. The O-1A, by contrast, requires a U.S. petitioner—typically an employer or agent—but offers more flexibility than traditional work visas.
...
