Introduction 
This report provides an in-depth analysis of the real estate market across multiple suburbs in Bundaberg, Queensland, focusing on data from the last three months of 2024 (June, July, and August). The aim is to highlight trends, rental yields, price growth, and overall investment potential, assisting both property owners and investors in making informed decisions. Overall Trends and Key Observations 
