proceeds by September 11, 2024. As provided in the California Cap-and-Trade 
Regulation, sellers who consigned allowances in this auction will be paid the auction 
settlement price in USD for every consigned allowance sold. Information regarding 
jurisdiction-specific auction proceeds will be published after the auction is final. 
California must receive auction proceeds only in USD. Québec must receive auction 
proceeds only in CAD. Thus, the total amount of auction proceeds received by the 
jurisdictions from the sale of allowances may be higher or lower than the auction 
settlement price multiplied by allowances sold depending on the prevailing exchange 
rates in effect at the time of currency exchange prior to the distribution of auction 
proceeds. Each jurisdiction will separately post information on September 11, 2024, 
providing the final amount of proceeds transferred. 
