The number of allowances auctioned each year is influenced by the Market Stability Reserve (MSR), which
adjusts the auction volumes based on the Total Number of Allowances in Circulation (TNAC). The TNAC
reflects the balance of supply and demand in the EU ETS1 since the begin of the second trading period in
2008. Since its introduction in 2019, the MSR has withheld allowances from auction each year due to the

