- KServe sklearn server: p99 7.2ms, 4,200 RPS/pod.
- Seldon MLServer: p99 6.8ms, 4,600 RPS/pod, gRPC 18% faster.
- BentoML: p99 5.9ms, 5,100 RPS/pod – minimal framework overhead.

