| `RAY_SERVE_USE_GRPC_BY_DEFAULT` | 1 | unset |
| `RAY_SERVE_THROUGHPUT_OPTIMIZED` | 1 | unset |
| `RAY_SERVE_RUN_ROUTER_IN_SEPARATE_LOOP` | 1 | unset |
| `RAY_SERVE_RUN_USER_CODE_IN_SEPARATE_THREAD` | 0 | unset |
