Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile S.A. (SQM), with headquarters in Santiago, Chile, is one of the world’s largest producers of specialty fertilizers, iodine, lithium, and other industrial chemicals. Many of the components of those products are extracted from the geomembrane-lined salar ponds operated by SQM.

