infringement lawsuit, in turn sued
you for indemnifcation because
your organization created a series of
marketing campaigns on behalf of that
client and someone is now alleging
that your campaign has “confusingly
similar” names and symbols to
their product.

•  A photographer sued you for

misappropriation because no one
