ORBCOMM is a global provider of IoT fleet management solutions with dedicated presence in the African market, offering satellite, cellular, and dual-mode tracking devices for trucks, trailers, containers, and refrigerated assets. Their hardware portfolio includes the CT 3000 reefer container tracker, BT 320 reefer trailer monitor, and Euroscan temperature recorders. The ReeferTrak and ColdChainView platforms provide comprehensive fleet monitoring through cellular and satellite connectivity.

Cold Chain Relevance: ORBCOMM provides end-to-end reefer tracking solutions designed specifically for African cold chain market demands, offering two-way monitoring and control of refrigerated trailers and intermodal containers. Their dual-mode satellite/cellular connectivity eliminates “black spots” where cellular coverage is unavailable—critical for African logistics corridors. Integration with Carrier and Thermo King refrigeration units enables remote temperature adjustment and pre-trip inspections. FSMA-compliant reporting generates documentation for food safety compliance while temperature charts and excursion alerts protect cargo integrity across land and sea transport.

