This wasn’t just any delivery; it was a solar powered refrigerator. Unlike old models that relied on fuel, batteries, or an unreliable electrical grid, this one ran on sunlight alone. And in remote villages where power failures had long put vaccines—and children’s lives—at risk, this fridge could change everything.
