Making Vaccines Work
InnovationHere’s how a specially-designed Vaccine Land Cruiser could help transform immunisation
Toyota’s Vaccine Land Cruiser has been helping ferry vaccines to remote areas of five African countries. Gavi’s Yoshinobu Nagamine and Mwenge Mwanamwenge talk us through the results.
29 September 2023
4
min read
byYoshinobu Nagamine, Mwenge Mwanamwenge
