##### STORE AND FORWARD
...
The transactions within the terminal must be “settled” daily. Read this section to ensure the settlement process operates smoothly.

The Store and Forward mode feature is a way to input credit sales into the terminal when there is no communication method available. Sales are then authorized and settled when a communication method is available. Note: Sales are not authorized until communication is available so there is a risk that the sale may not receive an approval. Merchant accepts all risk for transactions stored offline in Store and Forward mode.

ABOUT SETTLEMENT A Settlement operation is used to close the current batch and open a new batch for logging and accumulating transactions. ThePAXterminalstorestransactionsthroughout the day and sends batch totals of sales and refundsto the host after the close of business. There are two settlement options:Manual Settlement and Auto Settlement.

