(ii) 25.0063 x 6.9 kWh = 172.54 kWh

(iii) 172.54 x 25.20 cents = $43.48

So, for the same capacity of usage as one LPG gas cylinder, you would have to pay roughly $45. This is somewhat higher than the current top range of the LPG gas cylinder price.
