...
The Code of Practice on Environmental Health (COPEH) was last revised in September 2021. We have since received feedback seeking clarity on the following:

i. Section 3 Ventilation, Ducting and Kitchen Exhaust Systems in Food Shop: minimum separation distance between kitchen exhaust outlet and the building it is facing; and

ii. Section 4 Cooling Tower: acceptable structural measures;

