The mobile checkout at Bass Pro Shops doesn’t have a “Review Order” step and doesn’t allow users to easily edit their order on the “Order Confirmation” page. Consequently, a single accidental click on the “Submit Order” button on the checkout page will require serious effort from the user to remedy.
