## 1. The cart abandonment rate in 2025 will be 62.9%. Six in ten people will leave without buying anything.
...
A survey was conducted over the course of 2025 on 4,374 e-commerce sites with monthly sales of over 5 million yen that use CART RECOVERY, and the average cart abandonment rate was found to be 62.9%.

Although there was a slight decrease of 0.4 points compared to the previous year, the situation remains the same: "more than six out of ten customers who added items to their cart abandon them." This is not limited to a specific site, but can be said to be a universal issue across the entire e-commerce industry.
...
What is more noteworthy than the 62.9% cart abandonment rate is the "opportunity loss" in monetary terms.
...
According to this survey, the amount of opportunity loss caused by abandoned carts (the total value of items left in the cart but not purchased) is approximately 2.6 times the actual sales amount .
...
