[1] When to Show a Suggestion? Integrating Human Feedback in AI-Assisted Programming
							| Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (2024-03-24T18:43:49.000Z)
URL: https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/28878
- Hussein Mozannar Massachusetts Institute of Technology 
