### What is the range of an outdoor LoRaWAN® gateway?

The coverage of an outdoor LoRaWAN® gateway depends on terrain, antenna setup, installation height, and interference levels. In general, it can reach up to 15 km in rural or open areas and up to 2 km in urban environments with dense buildings and interference. Under ideal test conditions, LoRaWAN® has even achieved a world record communication distance of over 1,300 km, highlighting its extreme long-range capability, though such performance is not representative of real-world deployments.

