 Where is the data saved? 

Honeywell Versatilis Insights data is saved securely into the cloud. This allows users to access synchronized information across sites and devices. Currently it is not possible to save Honeywell Versatilis Insights data to a local database, however this is a feature we are investigating for a future release. 

 How secure is my data? 

Honeywell Versatilis Insights data is saved securely into the cloud. Permissions to access data are controlled by your company administrator. They have full control over which users have access and can modify your data. 

