Equipment Health Monitoring (HVT)
Honeywell Versatilis™ Transmitter
equipment health monitoring hvt
Honeywell Versatilis™ TransmitterHoneywell Versatilis™ Transmitter is a multi-variant sensing platform based on the latest LoRaWAN® protocol communication technology. Low power consumption and easy installation helps manufacturers to deploy it at a scale while keeping OPEX low.
