Selection and ordering data

Selection and ordering data

SITRANS MS200
A battery-powered, wireless multisensor that provides
process condition data that is collected in addition to the
core process control data.

SITRANS CC220
A cloud connector that collects measurement and status
data from up to eight SITRANS MS200 multisensors, then
forwards it to the SITRANS SCM IQ cloud application

SITRANS SCM IQ
SITRANS SCM IQ is a Siemens Insights hub-based applica­
tion, used in conjunction with SITRANS MS200 and
SITRANS CC220, for smart condition monitoring and pre­
dictive maintenance

