## Pricing Structure and Packages

Siemens has structured Insights Hub pricing to provide flexibility and scalability for organizations of all sizes. The updated packaging and pricing model allows companies to tailor their IIoT environment to match specific capability requirements and resource needs, with options for powerful add-ons as operations scale.

The pricing model follows a two-step approach: first, select the capability package that matches your out-of-the-box requirements; second, choose the appropriate asset attribute size and cloud resource packages to meet your data volume and processing needs. This modular structure ensures organizations pay only for the capabilities they need while maintaining the flexibility to expand as requirements grow.
...
- Premium Package: Unleashes the full capability of Insights Hub at enterprise scale. This comprehensive package supports complete business transformation with deep, actionable insights across all operations. The Premium package includes advanced AI and machine learning features, unlimited application development, and maximum data processing capabilities. It is designed for large-scale deployments across multiple facilities or global operations.
...
Pricing is typically quoted on an annual subscription basis, with costs varying based on the number of connected assets, data volume, and required features. Siemens works with customers to design pricing structures aligned with specific business outcomes, often including performance-based pricing models tied to measurable improvements in efficiency or cost savings.
