Side effects of antibiotics vary, and can include
nausea and headaches. Talk with your doctor if you
experience increased severity of symptoms while
on antibiotics.

OVERVIEW

EXA MPLE S

These medications are used primarily
to treat UC, both to reduce symptoms
and to maintain remission. They work by
decreasing the inflammation in the lining
