Published wages for mechanical engineers in Colorado, straight from the BLS Occupational Employment and Wage Statistics May 2024 release — the full percentile distribution, employment concentration, and metro detail.

Mechanical Engineers in Colorado earn a median of $108,060 per year ($120,890 mean), per BLS OEWS May 2024. The middle 50% earn $89,470–$137,530; the top 10% earn $176,300. That is 6% above the national median of $102,320, ranking Colorado #12 of 51 states that publish this occupation.
