### SDE 3 - The Senior Engineer

SDE 3 roles are for highly experienced engineers with more than five years of experience. These engineers are experts in their domain and are responsible for designing and architecting complex systems. 

SDE 3 engineers often lead teams, make critical technical decisions, and contribute to the strategic goals of the organization.

In India, SDE 3 salaries start at ₹30 LPA and can go up to ₹50–70 LPA in leading tech companies and unicorn startups. 

These roles typically include substantial bonuses, equity options, and other perks, reflecting the high level of responsibility and expertise required.
...
Several factors influence SDE salaries, including location, skill set, industry demand, and the reputation of the company. Cities like Bangalore, Hyderabad, and Pune offer higher salaries due to the concentration of tech companies. 

Specialized skills such as machine learning, cloud computing, and DevOps also command a premium.

Additionally, candidates with experience in product-based companies tend to receive higher offers due to the rigorous technical standards and problem-solving expertise required in these environments.
