# The Cambrian conundrum: early divergence and later ecological success in the early history of animals.

 Author(s): Douglas H Erwin 1, Marc Laflamme, Sarah M Tweedt, Erik A Sperling, Davide Pisani, Kevin J Peterson 

 Publication date (Electronic): Nov 25 2011 

