Integrated records of environmental change and evolution challenge the Cambrian

Explosion

Rachel Wood1*, Alexander G. Liu2, Frederick Bowyer1, Philip R. Wilby3, Frances S. Dunn3,4,,

Charlotte G. Kenchington2,5, Jennifer F. Hoyal Cuthill2,6,  Emily G. Mitchell2, and Amelia

