[3] "Evaluation of Air Conditioning Performance Degradation: Opportunities " by Florida Solar Energy Center and Karen Fenaughty
URL: https://stars.library.ucf.edu/fsec/46/
"Evaluation of Air Conditioning Performance Degradation: Opportunities " by Florida Solar Energy Center and Karen Fenaughty
