## Lennox SL28XCV AC Review

Lennox SL28XCV is among the most efficient air conditioners in the market. It used to be the efficiency champion of Lennox (up to 28.0 SEER, or approximately 25.8 SEER2), and it is still an elite model.

It is a fully variable-capacity system, like other flagship units, and it continually varies its output to maintain precise temperature and humidity. It is also a fully communicating device, which is meant to be used with Lennox smart thermostats.

The SL28XCV is similar to the SL25KCV in most ways: variable-speed inverter compressor, SilentComfort noise suppression, and high-quality construction. It normally runs at around 59 dB which is very silent compared to a central AC.It also has the advanced technology of Lennox to perform best in different climates. Among the differences, it does not have the new low-GWP refrigerant since it operates with R-410A. Nevertheless, it is still compliant with existing installations and will be serviceable over years.

The model is ideal in the case of homeowners that desire the highest level of efficiency and have a high number of annual cooling hours. Its radically lower energy consumption can save large amounts of money in areas that have hot summers or expensive utilities.

