# Most Reliable Central Air Conditioning Systems
Only a few stand out for reliability or owner satisfaction in CR member surveys 
![Mary Farrell headshot](https://article.images.consumerreports.org/image/upload/w_112,h_112,f_auto/prod/content/dam/headshots/CR-Headshot-Mary-Farrell)
By Mary H.J. Farrell
Updated by Quentyn Kennemer
Updated February 1, 2025
