Implement Hitch Harnessing 
Any extension harnessing needed to connect from the vehicle 
hitch to the control ECU. 
Implement Control Components 
Harnessing needed to interface the ISO ECU to the various control 
components on the vehicle. Implement harnessing is typically 
tailored to the specific application. Harnessing used in one 
application may not be compatible with another. 
