[4] Questions or Issues About Project Payments – Inglés
URL: https://help.workana.com/hc/en-us/articles/360041874873-Questions-or-Issues-About-Project-Payments
## 🧾 The project is pending payment guarantee or verification

If you've already made the payment and the project still appears as pending, don't worry! In some cases, the payment processor may take a little while to complete the transaction, or the payment may still be going through a verification process.

### ⏳ Payment guarantee pending

If you made the payment through Mercado Pago or in cash, the payment processor may take up to 72 hours to complete the process.

If the payment still appears as pending, we recommend waiting for this period before trying again.

To help us identify and process your payment more quickly, you'll find the “Attach receipt” button within the project. From there, you can upload your proof of payment.

### 🔎 Payment under verification

If your project shows “Payment Verification”, it means that we are reviewing the transaction.

There's no need to make another payment. Once we complete the review, we'll approve the payment or contact you by email if we need any additional information.

If you have questions about your payment verification, you can find more information in “ My payment is under Verification. What does this mean?”

