errors on an interactive map.

Register plots and
receive a deforestation
risk analysis report

 • Near real-time deforestation
risk analysis to understand
where follow-up is needed,
thanks to satellite-based
analysis from Satelligence.

 • Track plot mapping and
risk on digital dashboard that
allows cooperatives to switch
views between EUDR cut-off
date and Fairtrade cut-off
dates.

Share geolocation data
and reports

 • Create risk reports to
share with buyers or use for
the cooperative’s own risk
mitigation planning.

 • Convert geolocation data to
the standard GeoJSON format
required by the EU’s due
diligence platform (TRACES).

 • Securely share geolocation
data with buyers and assign
specific plots to a sales
contract.

