## Adapter X710-T2L/T4L

Overview 
Simplify technology transitions with the Intel® Ethernet Network 
Adapter X710-T2L and X710-T4L. Autonegotiation between port 
speeds provides maximum flexibility in dual and quad-port 
10GBASE-T configurations. These low-power adapters also support 
Energy Efficient Ethernet to efficiently reduce power consumption 
during periods of low data activity. 
The X710-T2L and X710-T4L are part of the Intel® Ethernet 700 
Series, the foundation for server connectivity; providing 
broad interoperability, critical performance optimizations, and 
increased agility for Communications, Cloud, and Enterprise IT 
network solutions. 
• Interoperability - Multiple speeds and media types for broad compatibility backed by extensive testing and validation. 
• Optimization - Intelligent offloads and accelerators to unlock network performance in servers with Intel® Xeon® processors. 
• Agility - Both Kernel and Data Plane Development Kit (DPDK) drivers for scalable packet processing.
