fader is assignable rather than fixed. Audio processors offer granular control. Built-in processing is now handled by a quad-core audio engine for low latency real- ... effects. Max preamp gain goes from 55dB to 76dB. The SMART pads now have eight banks and can do much more than trigger audio clips. Bluetooth connectivity is wider band for better quality. Dual USB-C interfaces allow two digital devices to be connected simultaneously. A new rotary encoder enhances user operation. Everything is colour coded ... A lot has changed.
