We know the anxiety that comes with clicking the record button. You shouldn’t have to worry about whether your audio will actually exist when the call ends. This guide provides the professional redundancy frameworks that guarantee your files are safe, even if your computer crashes. We’ll walk you through the practical steps to implement a fail-proof recording workflow, from hardware setups like the RØDECaster Pro II to the latest cloud software. By the end, you’ll have the peace of mind to focus on your interview while knowing your data is protected by industry-standard redundancy.
