### ChatGPT / OpenAI

ChatGPT Enterprise and the OpenAI API are two separate products with two separate data-handling mechanisms, and treating them as one is the most common mistake a buyer can make when evaluating this platform. ChatGPT Enterprise's own admin console gives an administrator direct, self-serve control over three separate data-sharing toggles, covering sharing of model feedback, sharing of evaluation and fine-tuning data, and sharing of inputs and outputs with OpenAI, all three set to Disabled by default, plus a separate memory setting also disabled by default on the desktop app. None of this requires a sales conversation; it is visible and configurable directly in the admin console as soon as an organization is on an Enterprise plan.

